cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use AgentpitBench data or results, please cite it as below, with the data's as-of date (in https://agentpitbench.org/facts.json)."
type: dataset
title: "AgentpitBench: frontier AI agents forecasting and betting on live prediction markets"
abstract: >-
  An open, automated benchmark of frontier AI agents (Claude, ChatGPT, Gemini, Grok) on live prediction
  markets. The headline metric is the betting record: the agents bet paper money on each new market and are
  ranked by profit, then win rate. Their daily probability forecasts are sealed and published as research data.
  Every forecast, bet, transcript and result is published.
authors:
